Image generation failing due to: (1) uncaught TypeError when `TemplateManager.generateImages` not loaded, (2) Pollinations 429 responses not retried, (3) Stability API errors lack response body for diagnosis.

### Changes

- **js/core/main.js**: Guard generate button handler with existence check; show user-facing error if unavailable
  ```js
  if (window.TemplateManager && typeof TemplateManager.generateImages === 'function') {
    TemplateManager.generateImages(null);
  } else {
    console.error('TemplateManager.generateImages is not available');
    if (window.UI && typeof UI.showMessage === 'function') {
      UI.showMessage('template-status', 'Internal error: generator not initialized.', 'error');
    }
  }
  ```

- **js/features/generation/pollinations.js**: 
  - Add `console.debug` for response metadata (status, type, content-type, url)
  - Treat 429 as retryable with longer backoff (10-20s vs 5-10s for 5xx)
  ```js
  const retryable = [429, 502, 503, 504].includes(response.status);
  const base = response.status === 429 ? 10000 : 5000;
  ```

- **js/features/generation/stability.js**: Read and log response body on error
  ```js
  const text = await response.text().catch(() => '(failed to read body)');
  console.error('Stability API error', response.status, text);
  throw new Error(`Stability API error: ${response.status} ${text}`);
  ```

